WEBVTT

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.520
It seems that Yaze Akishige was ousted from power.

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.440
It's not a big problem.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.990
We predicted that his plan was going to fail sooner or later.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:17.800
But as a result, the Tenth Familiar of
 the Fourth Progenitor was released.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:18.990
Hmph.

00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:22.500
Nevertheless, that man is at best a counterfeit Progenitor.

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.440
It's not at the point where he's a threat that needs to be dealt with.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:28.990
So it doesn't matter if we just sit back and watch.

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.080
Right.

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:33.270
For our countries that are part of the Holy Ground Treaty,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.670
that island still has value.

00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:38.940
Inform the countries to avoid unnecessary contact.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.760
I object!

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.520
The situation has changed.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:47.650
The Snake Charmer from the Warlord's Empire got his hands on knowledge from The Cleansing.

00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:50.480
That man will eventually obtain Cain's Legacy.

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:55.110
That will pose a grave threat to us.

00:00:55.220 --> 00:00:57.670
Therefore, I have something to ask of you.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.930
Activate the special forces.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.410
I command you! Destroy the demon district of the far east.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.940
You want to buy valentine day's chocolates?

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:39.410
With Nagisa and the others?

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:43.080
Yep. There's a special shop in the Tedis Mall.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.070
Oh, it's already this time of the year?

00:02:46.420 --> 00:02:47.890
But I'm a little surprised.

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:51.050
You knew about Valentine's day?

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:51.730
Huh?

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:55.010
I thought maybe you've never eaten chocolate before.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.490
What do you think I am?

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.750
They sold chocolates at High God Forest.

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:05.450
In particular, Sayaka-san pours her heart into Valentine's Day every year.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:07.730
It's very delicious.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:10.480
As part of the War Dancer's assassination training,

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.520
she also learns cooking skills.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:16.030
That kinda makes me want to taste it and kinda not...

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.770
Anyway, Himeragi, why don't you make a snack?

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:22.490
Eh? Me...?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:26.350
Damn it Yaze!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.880
What the hell are you doing?

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:30.800
Nagisa! Don't just stand there and watch. Stop him!

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:35.760
To the traitor who tried to force Himeragi-chan to make chocolates for him,

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:38.450
I came to administer divine punishment.

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:40.110
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:43.050
I'm not interested in receiving chocolates from Himeragi.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:47.810
You're not interested in my chocolates...? Is that so?

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:49.400
What? Himeragi?

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.670
Geez, you shouldn't be like that, Kojou-kun.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.800
You receive expensive chocolate from Asagi-chan every year

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.980
and you still want Yukina-chan's handmade ones.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.170
No, that's not what I meant!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.010
And Asagi's chocolates

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:05.750
is the almost-expired discount product from the nearby supermarket, right?

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:07.610
Discount product?

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:11.150
How can Asagi-chan's chocolates be discount products!?

00:04:11.190 --> 00:04:14.310
The expiry date is short because they are premium products!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.790
How do you not know this?

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:19.590
Ah? There's Asagi-chan.

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:22.020
Maybe she wants to go to Tedis Mall?

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:23.370
In that case, let's go together...

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:29.490
That guy...

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.240
was one of Vatler's aids.

00:04:31.910 --> 00:04:32.980
Lord Jagan.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:36.720
Asagi-chan.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:43.390
Why did... Asagi go with that guy?

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.790
Wait! Hey, Glenda!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.010
No!

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.520
Don't run around like that... and put on some clothes!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.560
Da!

00:04:57.650 --> 00:04:59.210
Yuiri!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:01.590
Yuiri!

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.400
Yuiri, hold her right there.

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:06.810
Shi..Shio-chan, what happened?

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.520
This child ran away without putting on clothes.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:12.900
No! Pool! I want to go on the water slide!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.930
Well... the checkup is finished, right?

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:17.450
Barely yea...

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:20.290
I got it. Let's go to the pool then.

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:21.410
Pool!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:25.460
That's way too easygoing...

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:29.480
Did you find out anything about Glenda?

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:33.230
The detailed test results will take two weeks.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:36.520
What we do know so far:

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:41.150
Glenda's existence does not follow any known evolutionary system.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.000
In addition,

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.870
her genes show evidence of magical enhancement at the molecular level.

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.500
That means... she's like a homunculus.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:53.750
Yeah. She's a dragon artificially created by someone.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:56.230
That's assuming the contents of the report is correct.

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.760
Artificially created dragon... is that possible?

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:03.720
Who knows? That's impossible with current human technology.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:06.920
But if it's technology from the Devas, then it's hard to say.

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:11.750
Although I don't know why they would want to create a dragon.

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:13.750
Why...?

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:15.250
Yuiri!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:18.030
The swimsuit is ready. Pool!

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.740
Maybe because she's cute?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.050
That's not impossible.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.070
Da.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:27.270
Now that I think about it,

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:30.570
Prince Aziz of the Dynasty of Destruction said that

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:33.200
the dragon is the guardian of the treasure.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.720
That's the reason they created Glenda?

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.820
But there's no treasure in Lake Kannawa.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:41.000
Yeah. But...

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.200
what if Glenda herself is the treasure?

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:45.150
Oh.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:48.240
That's right, the Self-Defense Force's Azama-san said that too.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:53.560
Glenda is the guardian of Cain's Legacy and the container of God's information?

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.640
God's... information?

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:00.030
Shio-chan!

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:00.820
I know!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.420
What is this overwhelming magic power?

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:05.240
Glenda, come here quickly!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:06.390
Da?

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:12.970
Attack mages from the Lion King Organization?

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.720
Return the lake dragon to me.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.020
Who are you?

00:07:20.150 --> 00:07:22.470
My name is Veres Aladar.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.120
A descendent of the First Progenitor, The Lost Warlord.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:27.940
Huh?

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.810
The Imperial Council Chairman, His Majesty Aladar?

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.760
That lake dragon has been identified as a major threat by the Holy Ground Treaty Organization.

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.830
So I'm tasked with reclaiming her.

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.260
Reclaimed...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.530
by the Holy Ground Treaty Organization?

00:07:43.200 --> 00:07:45.810
What are you going to do to Glenda after you take her back?

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:49.230
Neutralized, sealed, or dismantled.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.930
Regardless, it's not something you can interfere with.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:55.720
How can I hand her over after hearing that!?

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:58.720
I see. Too bad.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.040
Glenda, get back.

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.640
Rozen Cavalier Plus, boot up!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:15.400
Authenticate, Freikugel plus! Proto III, unlock!

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:19.170
I, War Dancer of the High God, as
a dancer of the Lion, beseech thee...

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.070
Light, come forth!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.480
No, Shio-chan!

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.730
Pierce it, Invidia!

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.410
Yuiri! Shio!

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:36.610
Run away... Glenda!

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:39.050
Go to Itogami Island.

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:42.390
Look for Kojou-kun and Yuki to help you. Understood?

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.360
No...

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.730
Yuiri... Shio...

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.020
Hurry! Glenda!

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.020
Da!

00:08:54.340 --> 00:08:56.180
Dance, Ghoulah!

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.170
Nephila Ignis!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:07.650
It's you... Kira Lebedev.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:09.510
Did Vatler send you?

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.600
What does that man want Glenda for?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.850
You should know more about his disposition than I,

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:20.800
His Majesty Aladar.

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:25.810
All the more reason I cannot give Glenda to that man.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:26.660
Ghoulah!

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.400
Tsk...

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.900
Dionycha Nox.

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:37.120
Image projection...

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:42.160
Thank goodness... Glenda...

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:45.540
Sorry to get you involved...

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:48.130
Yuki... Kojou-kun...

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:59.530
Oh! This is centainly a rare guest.

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:04.040
Even after seeing my figure, thy mood is still undisturbed?

00:10:04.590 --> 00:10:06.020
I'm surprised.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.470
After all, I thought it was almost time for someone to warn me.

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:14.520
So, can you tell me what number you are?

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:16.260
I am Hektos.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:19.280
The Sixth Kaleid Blood.

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.800
Akatsuki Kojou's mother.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:25.370
Does thou wish to resurrect my brethren?

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.120
To be precise, it's creation by duplication

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:31.250
from the previous Fourth Progenitor.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:35.700
If we can create a clone of the Twelfth Kaleid Blood successfully,

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.930
we can transfer Avrora Florestina's soul into that clone.

00:10:40.510 --> 00:10:43.050
Of course along with her Familiar as well.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.850
Thou believe thy daughter can be saved this way?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.750
My daughter and my son will both be saved.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:50.720
Is that wrong?

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:55.790
Not wrong, but thy wish will not come true

00:10:56.260 --> 00:11:00.450
because the destruction of the body is her last will.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:04.830
But even so, I want to save those children.

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:06.020
Please!

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:12.170
Forgive me, for destroying her is my wish.

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.510
Forgive me...

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:33.890
Yesterday?

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.120
I didn't meet with anyone.

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:38.210
I was watching net dramas online.

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:41.560
But I saw you get into someone else's car.

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:43.070
You got the wrong person?

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.720
Oh, I got the wrong person...

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.740
How is that even possible!?

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:49.310
Why were you with that Jagan guy?

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.030
Huh?

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:53.310
You're annoying! Kojou, I said I don't know!

00:11:53.310 --> 00:11:54.260
Hey, Asagi.

00:11:54.300 --> 00:11:56.790
I need to go to the staff room to get the printouts.

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.550
You're in my way.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:01.240
Wait, I'm not done talking to you.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.720
Stop! Akatsuki-kun.

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:06.080
Calm down. I get that you're jealous.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.200
For now, you should keep your distance and calm down.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.250
Jealous? That's not it.

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.360
This has nothing to do with jealousy.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:14.940
Please... I didn't want to say anything.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:17.680
But to let things get to this point is your fault too.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:22.650
You always leave Asagi behind to frolic with your sister's friend.

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:24.650
What the hell are you talking about!?

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:27.200
It's too noisy, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:30.440
What are you yelling about first thing in the morning?

00:12:30.670 --> 00:12:31.670
Natsuki-chan!

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.380
Perfect timing.

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.120
Where's Tobias Jagan of the Warlord's Empire?

00:12:38.340 --> 00:12:39.870
Jagan? Who knows?

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:42.590
But the Island Management should know, right?

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:45.040
Asagi met with him yesterday.

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:47.000
She was concealing it from us.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:49.000
So where's the problem?

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.830
This is the Demon District.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.750
If Asagi and a noble of the Warlord's Empire wants to meet secretly,

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:56.330
she's free to do that.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.970
But he is one of Vatler's underlings.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:02.130
He's not an underling. He's an ally on equal terms.

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:07.410
Anyway, an influential person like that would not be interested in a little girl.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.660
A little girl... Natsuki-chan, aren't you embarrassed to say that?

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:11.040
Shut up!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:11.540
Ouch!

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:18.240
Even if Jagan is after Asagi, he's free to do that.

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.700
Don't panic just because someone stole your woman.

00:13:22.110 --> 00:13:24.340
Is that something a teacher should be saying?

00:13:24.340 --> 00:13:27.800
Go back to your seat. Homeroom is starting.

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:37.510
Glenda!

00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:38.940
Da...

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.910
Wait, you! Don't transform back to human in such a place.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.330
Kojou... Kojou... Kojou...

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:52.750
Wait...wait a minute. Glenda, put my jacket on first.

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:57.910
Eh? Told you to run away? Who was after you?

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:02.440
Yuiri... and Shio... at the pool...

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:08.120
Duck! Glenda!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:13.280
What the hell are you doing?
 That's a complete violation of aviation law!

00:14:13.660 --> 00:14:14.450
Kojou!

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.810
Human... that's not right.

00:14:19.470 --> 00:14:22.250
Boy, are you a vampire too?

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:23.590
Who are you?

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:25.870
Did you attack Yuiri-san and the others?

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:29.590
I see, are you an acquaintance of theirs?

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:31.430
Then I shall return these to you first.

00:14:34.610 --> 00:14:37.490
You... what did you do to them?

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.890
They interfered with my objective. So I got rid of them.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.020
Objective?

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:44.150
To punish Glenda.

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.420
All right. Hand over that little girl to me, boy.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.990
Otherwise, you will meet the same fate as them.

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:54.330
Don't mess with me!

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:56.340
Come, Regulus Aurum!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.270
The Fourth Progenitor's Familiar...

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.130
Awaken, Acedia!

00:15:08.820 --> 00:15:10.240
Dance, Ghoulah!

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:11.440
Shit!

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.440
Sekkarou!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:14.760
Himeragi!

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.490
Are you all right, Senpai?

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:19.280
There's a lot of questions I want to ask.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:21.900
But right now Glenda's safety is the most important thing.

00:15:22.000 --> 00:15:23.220
That's right.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:26.320
Wait, why are you in your P.E. uniform?

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:29.400
Because I got here right before P.E. class starts.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.770
Is that the Schneewalzer?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:36.550
Certainly, you are qualified to be the Fourth Progenitor's observer.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:39.050
That's a troublesome weapon.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:42.840
The boy who claims to be the Fourth Progenitor

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.590
and the Sword Shaman of the Lion King Organization,

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.790
this is your final warning.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.800
Hand over Glenda.

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.470
That's enough, Veres Aladar.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.470
Minamiya Natsuki.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.340
The Witch of the Void, eh?

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:02.000
This school is my workplace.

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:06.280
If you leave as you've been told, I will be very grateful.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:10.310
You demon lover. 
Do you think you can defeat me?

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:11.520
Answer me this.

00:16:12.050 --> 00:16:16.810
If I really wanted to hide Glenda,
 do you seriously think you are capable of finding her?

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:22.960
Indeed, it's not a good idea to make you my enemy here.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.820
I offer you my apology, Witch of the Void.

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.610
Boy, your name?

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:32.310
Kojou. My name's Akatsuki Kojou.

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:39.610
Then, we'll start over. Akatsuki Kojou.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:42.930
In the name of the Imperial Council Chairman of the Warlord's Empire,

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:45.060
Veres Aladar,

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:47.920
I challenge you to a duel

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:50.880
at sunset today.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.930
The location is Island North Area D.

00:16:54.560 --> 00:17:00.250
The condition for victory is... that one side
 admits defeat or becomes incapable of fighting.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:04.320
If you lose, you will hand Glenda over to me.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.350
And if I win?

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:10.870
I will return the two captured attack mages of the Lion King Organization to you.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:17.960
Furthermore, I guarantee that The Warlord's Empire will not target Glenda anymore.

00:17:18.630 --> 00:17:20.390
Can I trust you?

00:17:21.460 --> 00:17:24.050
I swear in the name of the Progenitor.

00:17:28.990 --> 00:17:31.950
Sword Shaman girl and the Witch of the Void,

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:37.050
I entrust you two to be present as witnesses in the duel.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:39.650
This is an acceptable arrangement.

00:17:40.330 --> 00:17:42.320
As long as you both think so.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:46.040
Good. Then I'll leave Glenda in your care until then.

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.880
That man is very strong, Akatsuki Kojou.

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:57.530
Maybe even stronger than Dimitrie Vatler.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:02.880
What? A duel?

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.880
What the hell are you thinking?

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:08.430
Your opponent is the Imperial Council Chairman of the Warlord's Empire!

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.360
Seems that way.

00:18:10.630 --> 00:18:15.370
Good grief! It was such a short acquaintance between you and I. Really...

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:20.840
Even dogs and cats know not to challenge opponents they have no hope of defeating.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.300
I didn't challange him!

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:25.950
Besides, they are the ones targeting Glenda.

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:29.490
The dragon child who was slumbering in Lake Kannawa?

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:33.880
That Kuraki woke up some troublesome things.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:38.050
Shike-sama, did you know Glenda-san's real identity?

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.640
Nothing more than the rumours.

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:41.910
Vampires,

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:46.040
especially those close to the Progenitors will oppose The Legacy of The Cleansing.

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:48.860
That makes perfect sense.

00:18:49.720 --> 00:18:53.750
But for someone like Aladar to personally appear is very unusual.

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:58.200
The dragon child may possess a secret.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.410
Glenda.

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:04.110
Well, whatever it is, you don't need to worry about it.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.590
Why?

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:09.830
In half a day you will be annihilated by Aladar.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:13.280
The dragon child will fall into the hands of the Warlord's Empire.

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:17.010
Two problematic issues will be solved at once.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:20.250
For the Lion King Organization it's a gift from heaven.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:21.700
S-Shike-sama,

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:26.230
even if it's Akatsuki Kojou,
 there are some things that shouldn't be said!

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:30.250
I can't help it! Akatsuki Kojou's chance of winning is zero.

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:31.920
Shike-sama.

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:37.020
Yukina, you just formed a contract with that idiot master. 
This is a critical moment where he might disappear forever.

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:41.450
As his blood servant, you should perform a final "service" for him.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.070
"Service", you say?

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:46.670
A "passionate and steamy" one...

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.500
No way! Blood servant!? Don't tell me...

00:19:52.360 --> 00:19:56.630
Did you finally force Yukina to do something unspeakable?

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.100
You Perverted Progenitor!

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:01.570
I didn't do anything like that. What are you imagining?

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.640
Calm down, Sayaka-san!

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:09.360
Basically, if Akatsuki-senpai defeats the Chairman, then there's no problem.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:13.200
I wont have to perform a "passionate and steamy service", right?

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.880
I don't recall ever asking for that!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.770
That's why you can't win!

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.890
The Fourth Progenitor is known as the strongest in the world

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:24.160
because her Familiars are the most powerful.

00:20:24.510 --> 00:20:28.370
But the problem is that you haven't mastered controlling them at all.

00:20:28.980 --> 00:20:31.700
You're like a student driver.

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:36.910
In other words, if I can control it then I can beat Aladar, right?

00:20:37.190 --> 00:20:38.350
In theory, yes.

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:39.760
What should I do?

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.120
Unfortunately, I don't know how.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:46.500
You have to ask a vampire for vampire-related things.

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:49.390
The only person I can think of is Vatler.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:53.620
I don't think he's going to teach me without wanting something in return.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:57.730
But there's no one else who's close to his level!

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.470
Even if you have to kneel, you have to do it!

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.320
No, but, you...

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.590
No, there is one...

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:07.290
Senpai, let's go eat ramen!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:11.800
I get it.

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:16.050
So that's why you came to disturb my meal?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.880
Now, what should I do?

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:22.330
Selling you a favour is not a bad idea.

00:21:22.830 --> 00:21:26.360
But I'm not sure it's worth provoking Aladar for it.

00:21:27.310 --> 00:21:30.020
I know it's a selfish request

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:31.690
but please accommodate us!

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:34.010
Glenda's life is in the balance.

00:21:34.650 --> 00:21:38.850
You have no reason to help the lake dragon.

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:42.240
Then why are you fighting Aladar?

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:43.250
That's...

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.570
No, that's true.

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:48.200
You are right, Prince.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:52.410
I have no reason to save her.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:57.390
I wanted to save her so I decided to save her. That's it.

00:21:58.180 --> 00:22:01.510
And for that you will kill Aladar?

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:04.480
I never had any intention of killing him.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:10.350
Hmph... It seems that I misunderstood you a little.

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:15.040
You are a much more arrogant person than I thought.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:15.750
Huh?

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:18.890
Have you noticed, Akatsuki Kojou?

00:22:19.320 --> 00:22:21.040
There's no reason or goal.

00:22:21.530 --> 00:22:23.870
You just do whatever you want.

00:22:24.130 --> 00:22:27.050
Even the enemy's life and death are at your discretion.

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:31.410
Only the strongest are permitted to think this way.

00:22:31.850 --> 00:22:33.410
It's the King's Privilege.

00:22:34.730 --> 00:22:38.980
Perhaps this is because you possess a Progenitor's potential,

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:41.870
or just unlimited stupidity.

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:47.560
Seeing how dumb you actually are, I'll give you a suggestion.

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:51.980
I'm not the one you should be asking for advice.

00:22:52.890 --> 00:22:55.790
When you realize who you should be asking,

00:22:56.290 --> 00:22:59.670
you should be able to stand on equal footing with Aladar.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:03.480
If you don't realize it in time, it'll be all over for you.

00:24:40.410 --> 00:24:45.210
Here is the position control software and
 image recognition algorithm you requested.

00:24:45.930 --> 00:24:49.130
I am grateful. I have received it.

00:24:49.130 --> 00:24:51.530
Then, where are the goods I requested?

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:53.810
They have already been delivered.

00:24:57.750 --> 00:25:00.120
Camouflage magic eh... not bad.

00:25:00.390 --> 00:25:01.990
But, Empress-dono,

00:25:03.590 --> 00:25:05.510
you wanted this much ground combat power.

00:25:05.680 --> 00:25:08.360
What do you intend to do with it?

00:25:08.650 --> 00:25:12.310
What do I intend to do with it? Isn't it obvious?

00:25:14.170 --> 00:25:15.270
For war!
